            "Enter number of vertices: 4\n",
            "Enter the adjacency matrix:\n",
            "Enter 99999 if there is no direct edge\n",
            " 0 5 99999 10 99999 0 3 99999 99999 99999 0 1 99999 99999 99999 0\n"
